            </p>
            <div class="ctas-left">
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">Tell us what you need</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flow" aria-label="Example: from a request to a working workflow">
            <div class="bubble">
              <span class="whoby">What the owner asked for</span>
              "Text clients a reminder the day before, and show me each barber's total at the end of
              the day."
            </div>
            <div class="beam-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="stages">
              <span><i>01</i>Planned</span>
              <span><i>02</i>Built</span>
              <span><i>03</i>On your dashboard</span>
              <span class="on"><i>✓</i>Live</span>
